scoot for Debian/Ubuntu
----------------------

The greeter entry lives at /usr/share/wayland-sessions/scoot.desktop:
pick "scoot" on your login screen (greetd, GDM, SDDM). Without a systemd
user manager scoot-session runs the compositor directly with no session
integration.

Copy /usr/share/doc/scoot/config.toml.example to ~/.config/scoot/config.toml
to start from the built-in defaults (it documents the [wallpaper]
handoff to scootbg, which ships in the scootbg package at the same
version -- the two install as a pair).
